01.webp","concept":"Soft conversion / guidance","cta":"Get free guidance"},{"id":"P3-B-02","stage":"BOFU","text":"Plain-English Life Cover Guide","img":"game/reassured/p3-b-02.webp","concept":"Guide download","cta":"Get the free guide"},{"id":"P3-B-03","stage":"BOFU","text":"Prefer to Ask a Human?","img":"inline/cd6a6dc92637413b.webp","concept":"Talk-to-us close","cta":"Talk to us"},{"id":"P3-B-04","stage":"BOFU","text":"No Trick Questions","img":"game/reassured/p3-b-04.webp","concept":"Trust close / no trick questions","cta":"Start the simple form"},{"id":"P3-B-05","stage":"BOFU","text":"We Translate. You Decide.","img":"game/reassured/p3-b-05.webp","concept":"Human close / we translate","cta":"Talk it through"},{"id":"P3-B-06","stage":"BOFU","text":"Grab the Checklist","img":"game/reassured/p3-b-06.webp","concept":"Lead magnet / checklist","cta":"Download free"},{"id":"P3-B-07","stage":"BOFU","text":"You've Got This","img":"game/reassured/p3-b-07.webp","concept":"Confidence close / you've got this","cta":"Finish my quote"},{"id":"P3-B-08","stage":"BOFU","text":"Stuck on a Word?","img":"game/reassured/p3-b-08.webp","concept":"Human close / call us kindly","cta":"Call us"}]],"pepsi":[[{"id":"P1-T-01","stage":"TOFU","text":"India’s greatest food stories were never written down – they were served. The table is the archive.","img":"inline/7e8177cc3e79eead.webp","concept":"Editorial / thought-leadership"},{"id":"P1-T-02","stage":"TOFU","text":"Your grandmother's recipe is one skipped generation from vanishing—and nobody wrote it down","img":"game/pepsi/p1-t-02.webp","concept":"Problem / tension framing"},{"id":"P1-T-03","stage":"TOFU","text":"Stop scrolling global food trends while the world's deepest food culture sits at your own corner stall.","img":"game/pepsi/p1-t-03.webp","concept":"Provocation / status-quo challenge","cta":"Shop now"},{"id":"P1-T-04","stage":"TOFU","text":"Be the friend who knows where the real kathi roll lives—the one who orders for the table","img":"game/pepsi/p1-t-04.webp","concept":"Identity / aspiration"},{"id":"P1-T-05","stage":"TOFU","text":"Half of what India's food creators post is heritage food—the feed already eats desi.","img":"game/pepsi/p1-t-05.webp","concept":"Peer / community proof"},{"id":"P1-T-06","stage":"TOFU","text":"Myth: street food is 'just snacks'. Truth: it is a 500-year-old kitchen with a queue.","img":"game/pepsi/p1-t-06.webp","concept":"Myth-bust / misconception"},{"id":"P1-T-07","stage":"TOFU","text":"A thousand regional dishes, one feed: heritage is nearly half of creator food content.","img":"game/pepsi/p1-t-07.webp","concept":"Statistic / insight hook"},{"id":"P1-T-08","stage":"TOFU","text":"The last bite of your mother's rajma tastes like being eight again","img":"game/pepsi/p1-t-08.webp","concept":"Human / empathy moment"},{"id":"P1-T-09","stage":"TOFU","text":"Imagine every gali stall with a line of twenty-somethings asking for the story, not just the plate","img":"game/pepsi/p1-t-09.webp","concept":"Vision / imagine"},{"id":"P1-T-10","stage":"TOFU","text":"What is a \"real food moment\"?","img":"game/pepsi/p1-t-10.webp","concept":"Category education / what is X"},{"id":"P1-T-11","stage":"TOFU","text":"The shift: young India is turning back to regional plates—thalis are the new tasting menus.","img":"game/pepsi/p1-t-11.webp","concept":"Trend / what's changing","cta":"Order now"},{"id":"P1-T-12","stage":"TOFU","text":"She asked her Nani for one recipe. Six Sundays later the whole colony came to eat.","img":"game/pepsi/p1-t-12.webp","concept":"Story / mini-narrative"},{"id":"P1-M-01","stage":"MOFU","text":"Bold cola, built to cut through spice – Pepsi is engineered for the Indian plate.","img":"inline/c8b3c4f5711eaa0d.webp","concept":"Product capability / feature"},{"id":"P1-M-02","stage":"MOFU","text":"Hot, spicy, fried – then cold, sharp, sweet.","img":"game/pepsi/p1-m-02.webp","concept":"Solution demo / how-it-works"},{"id":"P1-M-03","stage":"MOFU","text":"Plain water washes the flavour away","img":"game/pepsi/p1-m-03.webp","concept":"Comparison / vs the old way"},{"id":"P1-M-04","stage":"MOFU","text":"Chole bhature Sunday: the table splits the last kulcha, the Pepsi rounds it off.","img":"game/pepsi/p1-m-04.webp","concept":"Use-case / scenario"},{"id":"P1-M-05","stage":"MOFU","text":"324 creator posts on heritage food in 90 days","img":"game/pepsi/p1-m-05.webp","concept":"Proof / evidence / data"},{"id":"P1-M-06","stage":"MOFU","text":"The same crisp taste at a Delhi dhaba or a Kochi mess – chilled everywhere India eats.","img":"game/pepsi/p1-m-06.webp","concept":"Reliability / trust / quality"},{"id":"P1-M-07","stage":"MOFU","text":"From kirana to q-commerce, the bottle reaches the meal before the craving fades.","img":"game/pepsi/p1-m-07.webp","concept":"Workflow / integration","cta":"Order now"},{"id":"P1-M-08","stage":"MOFU","text":"That first cold sip between two bites of biryani – the pause that makes the meal","img":"game/pepsi/p1-m-08.webp","concept":"Comfort / experience"},{"id":"P1-M-09","stage":"MOFU","text":"A pairing grammar: rich dish + crisp cola","img":"game/pepsi/p1-m-09.webp","concept":"Curriculum / structure"},{"id":"P1-M-10","stage":"MOFU","text":"Street vendors are India's flavour professors – Pepsi sits in the front row","img":"game/pepsi/p1-m-10.webp","concept":"Expert / mentorship"},{"id":"P1-M-11","stage":"MOFU","text":"One Jaipur kachori stall, one cooler of Pepsi, one viral week","img":"game/pepsi/p1-m-11.webp","concept":"Case-study teaser"},{"id":"P1-M-12","stage":"MOFU","text":"'cola with traditional food?'","img":"game/pepsi/p1-m-12.webp","concept":"Objection handler / FAQ"},{"id":"P1-B-01","stage":"BOFU","text":"Tonight’s plan: order the dish your city is famous for – add a chilled Pepsi to the cart.","img":"inline/e99083d5df459411.webp","concept":"Offer / booking","cta":"Order now"},{"id":"P1-B-02","stage":"BOFU","text":"Do the pairing test at home: one plate, one cold Pepsi, tag @pepsiindia with the verdict","img":"game/pepsi/p1-b-02.webp","concept":"Demonstration request","cta":"Order now"},{"id":"P1-B-03","stage":"BOFU","text":"DM @pepsiindia your dish – get your pairing back","img":"game/pepsi/p1-b-03.webp","concept":"Consultation / talk-to-us","cta":"Talk to us"},{"id":"P1-B-04","stage":"BOFU","text":"Start small: a 250ml Pepsi beside your next street-food stop. That's the whole assignment.","img":"game/pepsi/p1-b-04.webp","concept":"Trial / starter","cta":"Order now"},{"id":"P1-B-05","stage":"BOFU","text":"Find the Pepsi cooler at your city's food festival","img":"game/pepsi/p1-b-05.webp","concept":"Event / congress","cta":"Order now"},{"id":"P1-B-06","stage":"BOFU","text":"Rate your table: post your spread, let the comments judge the pairing","img":"game/pepsi/p1-b-06.webp","concept":"Assessment / audit","cta":"Order now"},{"id":"P1-B-07","stage":"BOFU","text":"Go to the stall your city swears by","img":"game/pepsi/p1-b-07.webp","concept":"Reference / proof visit","cta":"Order now"},{"id":"P1-B-08","stage":"BOFU","text":"Creators: the food-trail collab is open pitch your city's plate to @pepsiindia","img":"game/pepsi/p1-b-08.webp","concept":"Programme / partnership","cta":"Order now"},{"id":"P1-B-09","stage":"BOFU","text":"Onam sadya to Diwali thali – this season, every festive plate gets its pairing.","img":"game/pepsi/p1-b-09.webp","concept":"Limited-time / seasonal activation","cta":"Order now"},{"id":"P1-B-10","stage":"BOFU","text":"Single-serve for the solo bite, sharing packs for the table – pick your size, keep it cold.","img":"game/pepsi/p1-b-10.webp","concept":"Pricing / package","cta":"Order now"},{"id":"P1-B-11","stage":"BOFU","text":"Worst case: you discover your new favourite dish. The pairing has no downside.","img":"game/pepsi/p1-b-11.webp","concept":"Reassurance / risk-reversal","cta":"Order now"},{"id":"P1-B-12","stage":"BOFU","text":"Follow @pepsiindia for the food trail – one region, one plate, one pairing at a time.","img":"game/pepsi/p1-b-12.webp","concept":"Direct CTA / get started","cta":"Get started"}],[{"id":"P2-T-01","stage":"TOFU","text":"Balance isn’t a diet – it’s a table where nothing is forbidden and everything is chosen.","img":"inline/93f64a0f7d59957d.webp","concept":"Editorial / thought-leadership"},{"id":"P2-T-02","stage":"TOFU","text":"You want the party and the plan. The guilt in between is the real enemy.","img":"game/pepsi/p2-t-02.webp","concept":"Problem / tension framing"},{"id":"P2-T-03","stage":"TOFU","text":"Who decided celebration must taste like compromise? Reject the either/or.","img":"game/pepsi/p2-t-03.webp","concept":"Provocation / status-quo challenge"},{"id":"P2-T-04","stage":"TOFU","text":"Be the host who serves indulgence and balance on the same tray – no lectures","img":"game/pepsi/p2-t-04.webp","concept":"Identity / aspiration"},{"id":"P2-T-05","stage":"TOFU","text":"India's creators are posting balance without boredom – flavour-first, mindful second.","img":"game/pepsi/p2-t-05.webp","concept":"Peer / community proof"},{"id":"P2-T-06","stage":"TOFU","text":"Myth: zero sugar means zero taste.","img":"game/pepsi/p2-t-06.webp","concept":"Myth-bust / misconception"},{"id":"P2-T-07","stage":"TOFU","text":"The health conversation is arriving in creator content","img":"game/pepsi/p2-t-07.webp","concept":"Statistic / insight hook","cta":"Learn more"},{"id":"P2-T-08","stage":"TOFU","text":"He skipped the dessert, then regretted the evening","img":"game/pepsi/p2-t-08.webp","concept":"Human / empathy moment"},{"id":"P2-T-09","stage":"TOFU","text":"Imagine a house party where nobody asks","img":"game/pepsi/p2-t-09.webp","concept":"Vision / imagine"},{"id":"P2-T-10","stage":"TOFU","text":"What is 'balance without boredom'?","img":"game/pepsi/p2-t-10.webp","concept":"Category education / what is X"},{"id":"P2-T-11","stage":"TOFU","text":"The shift: mindful choices moved from January resolutions to everyday tables.","img":"game/pepsi/p2-t-11.webp","concept":"Trend / what's changing"},{"id":"P2-T-12","stage":"TOFU","text":"Vikram swapped one thing at his dinner party – the fizz.","img":"game/pepsi/p2-t-12.webp","concept":"Story / mini-narrative"},{"id":"P2-M-01","stage":"MOFU","text":"Pepsi Zero Sugar: all the Pepsi taste, none of the sugar – that’s the whole trick.","img":"inline/dd9305cb9d745963.webp","concept":"Product capability / feature"},{"id":"P2-M-02","stage":"MOFU","text":"Same bold cola hit, zero sugar in the can – the swap works because the taste doesn't move.","img":"game/pepsi/p2-m-02.webp","concept":"Solution demo / how-it-works","cta":"Try it"},{"id":"P2-M-03","stage":"MOFU","text":"The old way: soda or self-control","img":"game/pepsi/p2-m-03.webp","concept":"Comparison / vs the old way"},{"id":"P2-M-04","stage":"MOFU","text":"Match night, snacks out, goals intact","img":"game/pepsi/p2-m-04.webp","concept":"Use-case / scenario"},{"id":"P2-M-05","stage":"MOFU","text":"8 of Pepsi's 25 recent posts already live on the balance beat – no rival runs it","img":"game/pepsi/p2-m-05.webp","concept":"Proof / evidence / data"},{"id":"P2-M-06","stage":"MOFU","text":"The recipe is Pepsi's own – the zero-sugar build holds the taste under pressure.","img":"game/pepsi/p2-m-06.webp","concept":"Reliability / trust / quality","cta":"Shop now"},{"id":"P2-M-07","stage":"MOFU","text":"Fits the fridge you already have: swap one shelf, change nothing else about the party.","img":"game/pepsi/p2-m-07.webp","concept":"Workflow / integration","cta":"Shop now"},{"id":"P2-M-08","stage":"MOFU","text":"Cold, sharp, guilt-free –","img":"game/pepsi/p2-m-08.webp","concept":"Comfort / experience"},{"id":"P2-M-09","stage":"MOFU","text":"The balance menu: bold mains, lighter sides","img":"game/pepsi/p2-m-09.webp","concept":"Curriculum / structure","cta":"Order now"},{"id":"P2-M-10","stage":"MOFU","text":"Chefs and trainers keep saying the same thing: balance beats bans. The can agrees.","img":"game/pepsi/p2-m-10.webp","concept":"Expert / mentorship","cta":"Or